        "message_text": "🪔🦃 **Diwali x Thanksgiving Potluck — two traditions, one table!**\n\nTeam, we are putting together a combined Diwali x Thanksgiving celebration — a potluck mixing the best of Indian and American traditions.\n\n**What we know so far:**\n• 🍲 Potluck format — bring a favorite dish (Indian, American, or a fusion of both)\n• 🌏 Cross-timezone friendly — coordinating with @kenji.sato on timing so our APAC folks can join in\n• 🙏 Please reply here (or DM) with what you might bring + any dietary restrictions or allergies\n\nFull details (date/time/location) will follow once we have them locked in. Looking forward to celebrating both festivals together! 🎉",
